<title>USA: Ashland sees spinoff of most of Blazer unit.</title>
<headline>Ashland sees spinoff of most of Blazer unit.</headline>
<dateline>ASHLAND, Ky 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ashland Inc said Thursday it was seeking approval for an initial public offering by its wholly-owned subsidiary Blazer Energy Corp with plans to later spin off the majority of the shares to its shareholders.</p>
</text>
